ilV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"SL_340_3x50AC_Affutage","description":"Sortie longue de 5h40 en endurance confort avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 3x50' à allure course, séparées par minimum 5' de récupération en endurance.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Cette sortie longue (la plus longue de tout ton programme) à 4 semaines de la course doit rester spécifique. Alterne entre l'endurance de confort et l'allure de course selon les indications. Profite de cette sortie pour tester ta nutrition et tes équipements comme expliqué dans les articles joints à tes semaines.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"trail_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EC_160","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":338,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z1","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":160,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"AC_50_Indif","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Allure course","value":693,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z1","abstract":true,"slug":"race","context":"intensity","perception":"target"},"durations":[{"value":50,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_5_Indif","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":338,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z1","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fo